id: pm-vcs-uploadretention
title: Define explicit expiry and abandonment for durable upload retention receipts
description: "GC conservatively keeps disconnected upload pins until durable refs, oplog or index roots own their objects. Define receiver-authorized receipt expiry and abandoned-session cleanup without weakening active lease or resumption guarantees."
